	"title"		"Fertilizer - Fertilize all nearby fields of the same crop"
	"description"		"[b]Stop opening every field to switch Fertilizer on.[/b]

Adds a button to the crop field window: [i]Fertilize all Wheat within 30 tiles[/i]. One click turns Fertilizer on for every nearby field growing the same crop.

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]Button in the crop field window; its label names the field's crop and the range, and follows the seed you pick
[*]Same crop only: other crops are left alone, and the button is greyed out on fallow fields
[*]Only switches Fertilizer on, never off; fields that already have it are skipped
[*]Setting [i]Fertilizer - range (tiles)[/i] in the Mods menu: 5 to 100 tiles (default 30)
[*]Uses the game's own Fertilizer switch, the same as the toggle in the window
[*]Works while paused, and does nothing in the background: it only reacts to your clicks
[/list]

[h2]Source[/h2]
[url=https://github.com/ringuh/whiskerwood-fertilizer]GitHub[/url]

Created using the [url=https://github.com/Whiskerwood-Modding/Whiskerwood-Project]Whiskerwood modkit[/url]."
	"changenote"		"First release."
